    "body": "Related: #40425\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\ndirectory buffers only get `filetype=directory` from the directory browser’s later autocmds, so `FileType directory` too late to use as the dispatch point for directory handlers.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nDetect real directories through `vim.filetype` as suggested by @justinmk and have the core directory edit path run filetypedetect before the later buffer-enter flow.",
    "closed_at": null,
